   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>CAN Interface (CanIf)</h2><p class=\"lead\">The CanIf abstracts CAN hardware details and provides uniform access to multiple CAN controllers and transceivers for higher-layer modules (PduR, CanTp, CanNm, CanSM).</p>",
